    "detailed_description": "<h1>#Special Compatible SteamDeck</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081330/extras/9e36884e9aae75c2be0e1e9555b86e23.avif?t=1754888648\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081330/extras/2783d63afdd6b4f53a6401a0bc94a6f3.poster.avif?t=1754888648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081330/extras/2783d63afdd6b4f53a6401a0bc94a6f3.webm?t=1754888648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081330/extras/2783d63afdd6b4f53a6401a0bc94a6f3.mp4?t=1754888648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game presents itself as a first-person survival game that you must face infested and mythical creatures for this purpose in order to have the totality of the character you control appears like this: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1: wasd to move you or zqsd </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2: mouse wheel for weapon switch\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081330/extras/c5bd8ef59d2c5eff565e8908514266a7.poster.avif?t=1754888648\" width=200 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081330/extras/c5bd8ef59d2c5eff565e8908514266a7.webm?t=1754888648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3: left click to zoom. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>little information above, be careful this game is in the beta alpha phase it is being built if you have to kill finish the game without dying or wtf if you want to hit bars the game is at no time has limits or without pity the game includes certain things uncensored if you like brutality this game is made for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081330/extras/bc971e546de21d65bea79056d1efb727.avif?t=1754888648\" data-has-big width=800 height=492 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Cobolia-Rojtoko Temple</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Temple Cobolia project has finally been released on steam. It does not include any project integrity, but I must warn you that it is in Alpha 5.1 phase.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you would like to test it, it's available on Bythzkel Sombr\u00e9a's playtest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081330/extras/9e36884e9aae75c2be0e1e9555b86e23.avif?t=1754888648\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>O\u00ba \u00b0 '\u00a8\u03c8 (Bythzkel-SOMBREA) \u03c8\u00a8' \u00b0 \u00baO</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thank you to those who want to test it, you can play it on your machine which is more than 10 years old, but just you will wouldn't put it in ultra or high quality</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081330/extras/aa0631952d086c820e6ac0b30e457ba2.avif?t=1754888648\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081330/extras/2fd9baefd34a47d3a0869d7dc371d9dd.avif?t=1754888648\" data-has-big width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to bythzkel sombr\u00e9a, this little inde game will allow you to discover the game in 1rd person view by controlling a lone soldier  who will have to eliminate the zombies affecting not an ancient mithic creature which has effect the astec population then your role is to kill until the last one in eleminant without getting killed.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game presents itself as a first-person survival game that you must face infested and mythical creatures for this purpose in order to have the totality of the character you control appears like this: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1: wasd or zqsd to move</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2: mouse wheel yo switch weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3: left click to aim.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>little information above, be careful this game is in the beta alpha phase it is being built if you have to kill to finish the game without dying or if you want to have fun the game has no time has limits, the game includes certain things uncensored if you like brutality this game is made for you.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Interesting little story, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I created this game for the purpose of reflection and concerted handling of this game and developed by a very limited game engine because I will not be able to make a small modification to limit it so as not to disturb its gameplay system blocked by a system where I cannot go further in my creation will remain free it will not change at its price which is visible to everyone it will remain free on all players who want to test it and give constructive opinions to go further.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081330/extras/f4acf1d72edd1357803544ef5420ab0f.avif?t=1754888648\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the little story of Bythzkel where you are the protagonist magician you must eliminate the zombie and the demon who reside in these places be careful not to die you must look for two chests hide on the map have as much fun as possible in this demo.</strong></h2>",
